  "statement": "# Dogwalk — task brief\n\nThis is a design target, not an implementation specification. Build your own GDD, scene structure, rules, and code.\n\n## Target player experience\n\nGuide a companion through a compact forest errand, find five distinct decorations, carry each one back, and finish the completed display.\n\n## Scope boundary\n\nA bounded third-person exploration and collection game with companion-mediated pickup and placement, readable objectives, recovery from mistakes, and a terminal completion state.\n\n## Creative freedom\n\nYou may choose the forest layout, decoration placement, traversal pacing, environmental dressing, and feedback presentation while retaining the five-item errand.\n"
}
